menuconfig FAILSAFE
	bool "ZX297520V3 Web Failsafe Recovery"
	select MTK_TCP
	select MTK_HTTPD
	select MD5
	default y
	help
	  Enable the Web-based recovery UI on port 80 to flash firmware, MTD partitions,
	  bootloaders and full flash images for Sanechip ZX297520V3.
